*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% Open-source driver for the Polono PL60 thermal label printer.
*% Not made, endorsed or supported by Polono. MIT licence, see LICENSE.
*% Option keywords match Polono's own PPD on purpose, so printers switched
*% over from Polono's driver keep their saved settings.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "PL60OPEN.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Polono"
*Product: "(PL60)"
*ModelName: "Polono PL60"
*ShortNickName: "Polono PL60 (open-source)"
*NickName: "Polono PL60 (open-source driver)"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:POLONO;MDL:PL60;CMD:TSPL;"
*PolonoProfile: "PL60"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 1.5
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 100 rastertotspl"

*% 4.25 in (108 mm) maximum width, 90 in maximum length.
*MaxMediaWidth: "306.14"
*MaxMediaHeight: "6480"
*HWMargins: 0 0 0 0
*CustomPageSize True: "pop pop pop <</PageSize[5 -2 roll]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*ParamCustomPageSize Width: 1 points 14.17 306.14
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 14.17 6480
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 0 0
*RequiresPageRegion All: True

*OpenGroup: General/General

*% Polono's own size names (wNNNhNNN) are kept so printers switched over
*% from Polono's driver keep their saved label size. The default is 100 x 150 mm,
*% not exact 4 x 6 in: many rolls sold as "4 x 6" are 100 mm wide, and a
*% 101.6 mm page prints ~1.6 mm off the right edge of them. Printing an exact
*% 4 x 6 PDF at 100 x 150 mm only scales it by 98%.
*OpenUI *PageSize/Label Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: w100h150
*PageSize w100h150/100 x 150 mm (most 4 x 6 rolls): "<</PageSize[283 425]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 4x6in/4 x 6 in (exactly 101.6 x 152.4 mm): "<</PageSize[288 432]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 4x4in/4 x 4 in: "<</PageSize[288 288]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 4x3in/4 x 3 in: "<</PageSize[288 216]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 4x2in/4 x 2 in: "<</PageSize[288 144]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 4x1in/4 x 1 in: "<</PageSize[288 72]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 3x2in/3 x 2 in: "<</PageSize[216 144]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 3x1in/3 x 1 in: "<</PageSize[216 72]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 2.25x1.25in/2.25 x 1.25 in: "<</PageSize[162 90]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 2.25x0.75in/2.25 x 0.75 in: "<</PageSize[162 54]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 2x2in/2 x 2 in: "<</PageSize[144 144]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 2x1in/2 x 1 in: "<</PageSize[144 72]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 1.5x1in/1.5 x 1 in: "<</PageSize[108 72]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 1x1in/1 x 1 in: "<</PageSize[72 72]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w100h203/100 x 203 mm: "<</PageSize[283 575]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w100h180/100 x 180 mm: "<</PageSize[283 510]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w100h113/100 x 113 mm: "<</PageSize[283 320]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w100h100/100 x 100 mm: "<</PageSize[283 283]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w100h80/100 x 80 mm: "<</PageSize[283 227]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w80h60/80 x 60 mm: "<</PageSize[227 170]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w75h45/75 x 45 mm: "<</PageSize[213 128]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 70x50mm/70 x 50 mm: "<</PageSize[198.43 141.73]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 60x40mm/60 x 40 mm: "<</PageSize[170.08 113.39]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize w57h45/57 x 45 mm: "<</PageSize[162 128]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 50x30mm/50 x 30 mm: "<</PageSize[141.73 85.04]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 50x25mm/50 x 25 mm: "<</PageSize[141.73 70.87]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 40x30mm/40 x 30 mm: "<</PageSize[113.39 85.04]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 30x20mm/30 x 20 mm: "<</PageSize[85.04 56.69]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

