*PageRegion w100h80/100 x 80 mm: "<</PageSize[283 227]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w80h60/80 x 60 mm: "<</PageSize[227 170]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w75h45/75 x 45 mm: "<</PageSize[213 128]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 70x50mm/70 x 50 mm: "<</PageSize[198.43 141.73]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 60x40mm/60 x 40 mm: "<</PageSize[170.08 113.39]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion w57h45/57 x 45 mm: "<</PageSize[162 128]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion 50x30mm/50 x 30 mm: "<</PageSize[141.73 85.04]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
