*OpenGroup: Quality/Quality

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 203dpi
*Resolution 203dpi/203 dpi: "<</HWResolution[203 203]/cupsBitsPerColor 1/cupsRowCount 0/cupsRowFeed 0/cupsRowStep 0/cupsColorSpace 3>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*% None sends 8-bit grey (the driver prints anything 50% grey or darker).
*% GrayScale sends 1-bit, dithered by macOS before the driver sees it.
*OpenUI *ColorOption/Grey Handling: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 310 AnySetup *ColorOption
*DefaultColorOption: None
*ColorOption None/Sharp (black or white): "<</HWResolution[203 203]/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsColorSpace 3>>setpagedevice"
*ColorOption GrayScale/Dithered: "<</HWResolution[203 203]/cupsBitsPerColor 1/cupsRowCount 8/cupsRowFeed 0/cupsRowStep 0/cupsColorSpace 3>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorOption

*CloseGroup: Quality

*OpenGroup: PrinterOptions/Printer Options

